# React / Frontend

Full rules: `.ai/rules/react.md`, `.ai/rules/frontend.md`

## Components

- Function components only; one primary component per file when practical
- Keep components ~**150** lines; extract hooks/subcomponents when larger
- Match existing UI tokens: `glass`, `border-line`, `bg-panel`, `text-fog`, `text-muted`, `btn-primary`

## State & data

- Local UI state stays local (`useState`)
- Auth mirror: `useAuthStore` + `useSession` — do not invent a second auth store
- Fetch via `apiRequest` and existing `/api/*` routes only
- Abort/ignore stale responses (`cancelled` flag or equivalent)
- Always handle **loading / empty / error**

## UX / a11y

- Images that matter need `alt`; decorative → empty `alt`
- Modals: Escape closes, backdrop click closes, restore scroll/focus
- Disable submit while in-flight; prevent double submit
- Prefer semantic HTML (`button`, `a`, `nav`) over div-click

## Images / media

- Use `@/components/Image/Image` or `resolveMediaSrc` — never treat `/avatars` or `/wallpapers` as local public files
- Pin previews must be size-capped (CSS/inline max-height); full-res only in fullscreen/download

